Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.Blueprint Name="BP_CameraManager"
   Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.EdGraph Name="UserConstructionScript"
   End Object
   Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.EdGraph Name="EventGraph"
   End Object
   ParentClass=/Script/VELOCITYX.VelocityCameraManager
End Object

/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Class: BP_CameraManager
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Camera/BP_CameraManager
Target Parent: AVelocityCameraManager (APlayerCameraManager)
Description:
   Dynamic 4-Mode Vehicle Camera Manager for VELOCITY X:
   1. Chase Camera (smooth follow behind car, speed pullback)
   2. Hood Camera (front hood driver perspective)
   3. Cockpit Camera (interior cabin view with G-force head inertia)
   4. Top Camera (bird's eye overview with yaw-only lock)
   Features smooth cubic Hermite blending, collision sphere sweep,
   dynamic speed FOV bonus, speed-based motion blur, and high-speed shake.
================================================================================

CLASS DEFAULTS CONFIGURATION:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- ChasePreset:
    * RelativeOffset: (-520.0, 0.0, 160.0)
    * LookAtOffset: (80.0, 0.0, 50.0)
    * BaseFOV: 85.0
    * PositionLagSpeed: 10.0
    * RotationLagSpeed: 8.0
    * SpeedPullbackDistance: 140.0
    * bEnableCollision: true
    * bFollowYawOnly: false

- HoodPreset:
    * RelativeOffset: (135.0, 0.0, 75.0)
    * LookAtOffset: (600.0, 0.0, 75.0)
    * BaseFOV: 95.0
    * PositionLagSpeed: 28.0
    * RotationLagSpeed: 26.0
    * SpeedPullbackDistance: 0.0
    * bEnableCollision: false
    * bFollowYawOnly: false

- CockpitPreset:
    * RelativeOffset: (-12.0, -34.0, 96.0)
    * LookAtOffset: (500.0, -34.0, 96.0)
    * BaseFOV: 90.0
    * PositionLagSpeed: 30.0
    * RotationLagSpeed: 30.0
    * SpeedPullbackDistance: 0.0
    * bEnableCollision: false
    * bFollowYawOnly: false

- TopPreset:
    * RelativeOffset: (-150.0, 0.0, 1300.0)
    * LookAtOffset: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)
    * BaseFOV: 70.0
    * PositionLagSpeed: 7.0
    * RotationLagSpeed: 6.0
    * SpeedPullbackDistance: 220.0
    * bEnableCollision: true
    * bFollowYawOnly: true

- Blending Settings:
    * BlendDuration: 0.45s
    * Interpolation: Hermite Smoothstep (3*t^2 - 2*t^3)

- Speed Effects & Post Process:
    * ReferenceMaxSpeedMPH: 200.0 MPH
    * MaxSpeedFOVBonus: +18.0 deg
    * FOVInterpSpeed: 4.0
    * bEnableMotionBlurEffect: true
    * MinMotionBlurAmount: 0.15
    * MaxMotionBlurAmount: 0.85
    * MotionBlurMax: Scales from 1.0 to 5.0 with speed

- Collision Sweep:
    * CameraCollisionChannel: ECC_Camera
    * CollisionProbeRadius: 18.0 units
    * CollisionRecoverySpeed: 8.0

- High-Speed Shake:
    * bEnableHighSpeedShake: true
    * ShakeSpeedThresholdMPH: 60.0 MPH
    * MaxShakePitchYawRoll: 0.75 deg
    * ShakeFrequency: 22.0 Hz
    * ImpactShakeClass: UVelocityImpactCameraShake

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EVENT GRAPH RUNTIME LOGIC:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Event OnPossess / SetTargetVehicle(Vehicle):
    TargetVehicle = Vehicle;
    ResetCamera();

Function CycleCameraMode():
    Switch (CurrentCameraMode):
        Case Chase   -> SetCameraMode(Hood)
        Case Hood    -> SetCameraMode(Cockpit)
        Case Cockpit -> SetCameraMode(Top)
        Case Top     -> SetCameraMode(Chase)

Function SetCameraMode(NewMode, bInstant):
    PreviousCameraMode = CurrentCameraMode;
    CurrentCameraMode = NewMode;
    If (!bInstant):
        bIsBlending = true;
        BlendTimer = 0.0;
        BlendStartLocation = CurrentLocation;
        BlendStartRotation = CurrentRotation;
        BlendStartFOV = CurrentFOV;
    Else:
        ResetCamera();

Event UpdateViewTarget(OutVT, DeltaTime):
    1. Calculate Target Transform based on Active Preset & Vehicle Transform.
    2. If Blending: Slerp Rotation, Lerp Location & FOV using SmoothStep curve.
    3. Else: VInterpTo Location (LagSpeed) & RInterpTo Rotation (RotLagSpeed).
    4. If Preset.bEnableCollision:
           SphereSweep(VehicleTarget, DesiredLocation, Radius 18);
           If Hit: SafeLocation = HitPoint + ImpactNormal * 23;
    5. Evaluate Speed:
           SpeedRatio = SpeedMPH / 200.0;
           DynamicFOV = Preset.BaseFOV + (18.0 * SpeedRatio);
           MotionBlur = Lerp(0.15, 0.85, SpeedRatio);
           If SpeedMPH > 60:
               Apply procedural harmonic vibration (Pitch, Yaw, Roll, Z);
    6. Apply Final Location, Rotation, FOV, and PostProcessSettings to OutVT.POV.
================================================================================
*/
